Structural Design Of 5 Nodes:-
============================


62 GB RAM + 62 logical CPUs + 405 GB available worker storage.

| Node         | OS     | CPU                       |    RAM | Available Disk | Rating             |
| ------------ | ------ | ------------------------- | -----: | -------------: | ------------------ |
| Core         | Ubuntu | AMD A9-9425, 2C           |   3 GB |         492 GB | 🔴 Weak            |
| Worker 1     | Kali   | i5-12500H, 16 CPU         |  15 GB |         106 GB | 🟢 Strong          |
| Worker 2     | Kali   | Ryzen 7 7435HS, 16 CPU    |  23 GB |         124 GB | 🟢 Best RAM        |
| Worker 3     | Kali   | i3-13150, 8 CPU           |  11 GB |          14 GB | 🟡 Storage-limited |
| Server 5     | Kali   | Core Ultra 7 155H, 22 CPU |  16 GB |         161 GB | 🟢 Best CPU        |


